From: Dmitry Muhomor <muhomor.dmitry@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Jan 2026 11:47:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gmscompat: send client SMS OTP receival broadcasts to
 GmsCore

Since 16 QPR2, unprivileged apps that have the SMS permission aren't allowed to read OTP SMS that
aren't addressed to them.

This commit allows GmsCore to receive OTP SMS receival broadcasts of SMS that are addressed to its
clients. GmsCore is trusted by its clients and they run the GmsCore client library inside their
own processes.

(cherry picked from commit 30d24e9f853aeb4e705910565369ab3a08dcbbb8)
(fixup squashed in: cherry picked from commit bc47021886dcc059971cf4b1877b54d08a9d4115)
